          distractors: ["80% savolga to'g'ri javob berdingiz", "natijalarning 20% i sizdan past", "siz eng yaxshi 80% dasiz"],
          hint: "p-foizil — pastdagi ulush.",
          steps: [`80-foizil: qiymatlarning 80% i shu natijadan kichik yoki teng`],
